Sequence of Cation/Anion Insertion
To understand the effect of inserting sequence, we compared the free energy surfaces obtained through different inserting sequences(Fig. 7). From this comparison, we can conclude that the details of the insertion procedure can be ignored and the ordering (and character) of the intermediate states does not affect the sampling, as expected, even for non charge-neutral states.
